OL,3,GNEWSAPattinson will be 'different',    
OL,4,Asays ex-Bond stuntwoman                
OL,6,F"He may be very good and the script may
OL,7,Fbe very good," she told BBC Radio      
OL,8,FSurrey. "We don't know because we      
OL,9,Fhaven't seen it."                      
